  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Central Continent, True Yang mountain range, is the setting where Vicious Lightning Fiend lands on a mountain peak to challenge Blazing Demonic Immortal Dan Qiao.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_vicious_lightning_fiend",
        "char_blazing_demonic_immortal_dan_qiao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The range is a very dangerous place, with countless fierce beasts inside.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At its periphery near Yuan Yang City, desolate beasts do not normally appear, and many Gu Masters stay active there.",
      "chapters": [
        850
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yuan_yang_city",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The setting sun shines on an uneven mountain range in Central Continent’s True Yang mountain range.",
      "chapters": [
        859
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Zi Xing says Dan Qiao hid inside True Yang mountain range after scarring him, and that Song Zi Xing later came there to settle the score when Dan Qiao accepted Vicious Lightning Fiend’s challenge. During the fight Song Zi Xing recognizes Heavenly Lotus Sect’s Immortal Gu House Illusion Garden and that Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects have joined against him.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "illusion-garden-ambush",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_illusion_garden",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Once Illusion Garden cracks and Song Zi Xing flees, a battle of pursuit appears on True Yang mountain range. He treats the range as his best hiding spot, and the chase disturbs large numbers of desolate beasts and even ancient desolate beasts that hinder his pursuers. A dim blood red light later flies out of the range with Song Zi Xing inside a golden bell, until an injured Gu Immortal confronts him and only a palm and forearm remain in the bell.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "illusion-garden-ambush",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan finds Song Zi Xing’s severed arm at the periphery of True Yang mountain range, near Yuan Yang City.",
      "chapters": [
        850
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "periphery-arm-site",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the failed ambush, many Gu Immortals move into True Yang mountain range searching for Song Zi Xing’s traces.",
      "chapters": [
        852
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "search-for-song-zi-xing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of Song Zi Xing, many Gu Immortals are in the range hunting him while also completing secret sect missions.",
      "chapters": [
        859
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "search-for-song-zi-xing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later tells Hei Lou Lan that even the ten great ancient sects of Central Continent cannot find Song Zi Xing in True Yang mountain range.",
      "chapters": [
        862
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "search-for-song-zi-xing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the Central Continent Refinement Path Convention ends, Yu Mu Chun enters True Yang mountain range and keeps moving without rest.",
      "chapters": [
        859
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yu-mu-chun-in-the-range",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement_path_convention",
        "char_yu_mu_chun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a mountain peak there he refines Immortal Gu amid wild winds.",
      "chapters": [
        861
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yu-mu-chun-in-the-range",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After refining the Immortal Gu, he travels deep into True Yang mountain range, conceals his tracks, and enters a spatial crack in a small valley that leads to Song Zi Xing’s blood swamp hideout.",
      "chapters": [
        862
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yu-mu-chun-in-the-range",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
